  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Inside every agent",
      "items": [
        "System prompts: shared base rules, one file per plugin, and the agent's own role file",
        "Skills: versioned step-by-step procedures the agent follows",
        "Scripts: command tools for replies, notes, timers and the database",
        "Knowledge: reference files and long-lived memory",
        "Threads: Rosie and Daisy keep one per job, customer or supplier; Lily and Nova keep a single thread. Each has a saved session"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Built-in and custom plugins",
      "items": [
        "Built-in on every agent: admin, scheduler, agent messaging",
        "Built-in, switched on per agent: Telegram, artifacts",
        "Custom, in harness/plugins: Web Chat, Supplier Events",
        "gws in harness/plugins is a local copy that replaces the built-in Gmail plugin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Who is reachable where",
      "items": [
        "Rosie: app chat, supplier portal, Telegram, supplier events; Gmail once her mailbox is signed in (polling is off)",
        "Daisy: app chat, Telegram, Gmail",
        "Nova: app chat, Telegram",
        "Lily: Telegram only",
        "Artifacts on Rosie, Daisy and Nova"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety and data",
      "items": [
        "Outside the admin chat, nothing an agent writes reaches a person until it runs a plugin's script",
        "The database tool allows reading, adding and updating, never deleting rows or changing tables",
        "Web Chat saves every app and portal chat transcript in Supabase",
        "App calls into the harness carry a shared secret; supplier wake-ups are best-effort"
      ]
    }
  ]
